WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.880
Whoa, this is crazy!

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.580
Oh my God.

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.980
Yeah, this is actually from Curry Barker's next short film.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.260
You know, the same guy that made Obsession.

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:06.980
Right, okay.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.680
I will say that for a headshot,

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.140
I'd expect a lot more blood coming out of that face.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.665
Yeah, I see a lot of cool, like, practical explosion stuff

00:00:14.665 --> 00:00:15.000
in here,

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.080
but no muzzle flashes or bullet hits.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.748
Well, guys, that's because there's no visual effects in any

00:00:19.748 --> 00:00:20.080
of this.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.080
And the reason is we're going to be doing them ourselves.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.460
Curry has reached out to us,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:26.200
the supposed YouTube kings of muzzle flashes,

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.672
to ask us if we would do gun effects for his next short

00:00:28.672 --> 00:00:28.880
film.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.800
It's time for us to put our money where our mouth is.

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:32.880
So come along for the ride while we go on set,

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.460
figure out how to make this stuff look good,

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:38.160
and deliver as realistic of an effect as we possibly can.

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:40.700
I'm Curry Barker, and you're watching Corridor Crew.
